# DDD - Domain Driven Design: {{ systemName }}
This is the comprehensive DDD reference document mapping our **Domain Taxonomy**, **Bounded Contexts**, and **Ubiquitous Language**. Use this file as the single source of truth for understanding system relationships, aligning terminology, and resolving semantic ambiguity.

## Domain Taxonomy

{% if domains %}
    {# Loop over domain taxonomy list #}
    {% for domain in domains %}
### {{ domain.classification }}: {{ domain.name }}
- **Description**: {{ domain.description }}
- **Strategic Value**: {{ domain.strategicValue }}
        {# Add the ubiquitous language terms for this domain, if any #}
        {% if domain.terms %}
- **Ubiquitous Language**:
            {% for term in domain.terms %}
    - **{{ term.name }}**: {{ term.meaning }}
            {% endfor %}
        {% endif %}

    {% endfor %}
{% else %}
*No domains defined*.
{% endif %}
